   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>跨期缺陷难匹配，里程漂移会扭曲腐蚀增长率。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>两次内检测信号、里程和缺陷尺寸。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>追踪疑似同一缺陷并估计增长风险。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='漏磁内检测原理与信号特征'><text x='20' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>漏磁（MFL）内检测：壁厚减薄处磁力线「漏」出来</text><rect x='30' y='42' width='330' height='14' rx='4' fill='#9ba3a9'/><rect x='30' y='120' width='330' height='14' rx='4' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='42' y='52' font-size='8.5' fill='#fff'>管壁（上）</text><text x='42' y='131' font-size='8.5' fill='#fff'>管壁（下）</text><rect x='60' y='56' width='24' height='64' rx='3' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.25' stroke='#41699b'/><rect x='96' y='56' width='24' height='64' rx='3' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.25' stroke='#41699b'/><rect x='78' y='48' width='24' height='18' fill='#41699b'/><rect x='78' y='110' width='24' height='18' fill='#41699b'/><text x='90' y='44' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b'>磁轭与磁刷</text><path d='M186,120 A14,14 0 0 0 214,120 Z' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.45' stroke='#b05a51'/><text x='200' y='152' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>腐蚀缺陷（壁厚减薄）</text><path d='M176,108 C182,96 218,96 224,108 C216,104 184,104 176,108' fill='none' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><text x='258' y='92' font-size='8.5' fill='#d47a3a'>磁力线绕过缺陷「外泄」</text><text x='20' y='180' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>信号特征：深度 → 幅值，长度 → 宽度</text><line x1='30' y1='228' x2='360' y2='228' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M40,222 L70,221 L88,196 L106,220 L150,221 L168,208 L186,222 L240,221 L262,190 L284,220 L330,221 L356,222' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.5'/><text transform=\"translate(0 20)\" x='96' y='188' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>浅·短</text><text transform=\"translate(0 24)\" x='258' y='182' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>深·长 → 大而宽</text><text x='368' y='240' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>里程 →</text><line x1='390' y1='30' x2='390' y2='235' stroke='#dfe6f0' stroke-width='1'/><text x='410' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>两次检测相减：增长率噪声大</text><line x1='410' y1='200' x2='706' y2='200' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='410' y1='50' x2='410' y2='200' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='410' y1='125' x2='706' y2='125' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><text x='700' y='120' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='end'>真实增长率 g</text><circle cx='450' cy='118' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='478' cy='132' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='505' cy='110' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='533' cy='128' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='560' cy='122' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='588' cy='112' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='616' cy='130' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='644' cy='120' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='672' cy='126' r='2.6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.7'/><text x='558' y='220' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>匹配对的观测增长率：围绕真值剧烈抖动，甚至为负</text><text x='404' y='44' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>增长率 %壁厚/年</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
