   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>匹配与回归不需要人工标注，但<strong>里程基准统一</strong>和<strong>开挖验证</strong>是硬前提：前者决定匹配质量，后者是唯一真值来源。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>内检测数据</span><span class='cl-s'>缺陷位置、深度、尺寸，数万条/次</span></span><span class='cl-n'>识别需人工抽检标定</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>两次检测对比</span><span class='cl-s'>同一定位点，间隔 5—8 年</span></span><span class='cl-n'>匹配结果按比例抽检</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>开挖验证</span><span class='cl-s'>实测深度，每次检测 5—20 处</span></span><span class='cl-n'>唯一真值，用于校准与验收</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>管道基础台账</span><span class='cl-s'>管径、壁厚、钢级、运行压力</span></span><span class='cl-n'>剩余强度计算的输入</span></div></div>"
